oad topic discovery because the task excludes an unidentified prior study and its discussion/citation pages.\n+\n+## Program Evaluations\n+No new evaluations are run in this planning stage.\n+\n+## Failures / Regressions\n+No retrieval or scientific computation is required. The initial paper_data.json display was oversized; subsequent inspection uses selected JSON fields.\n+\n+## Next Hypotheses\n+Plan bounded searches around already supplied permitted sources and older methodological work; do not infer architecture transitions or MT-Bench experiments from prospective memory.\n*** End Patch'\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
